id: settings-flick
section: Scrolling and gestures
item: Flick up and down on about:settings at both ends: the page coasts (the card's scroll well past the finger's travel), and a flick down at the top stays at the top
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: about:settings
kit: cavekit-chrome-look.md R3
wait rect page-title 20
calibrate page-title
flick 480 900 480 250
expect card-scroll-min 500
flick 480 250 480 900
flick 480 250 480 900
flick 480 250 480 900
expect card-scroll 0 5
